  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winter assistance to vulnerable families in Herat Province through cash for winterization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the 2024 ICCT Winter Prioritization and ESNFI cluster analysis, Farsi District in Herat Province is identified as a priority area for winterization support. The district faces severe seasonal risks due to harsh winter conditions, which significantly impact vulnerable populations. The analysis highlights the urgent need for multi-sectoral assistance, including the provision of winter-specific supplies such as blankets, warm clothing, and heating materials. These items are essential to help families survive the cold months and protect them from the harsh weather.
Additionally, the harsh winter conditions, with temperatures dropping significantly, have left many families without necessities. The provision of warm clothing, blankets, and heating materials is crucial to prevent hypothermia and other cold-related illnesses. Based on Cordaid&apos;s recent rapid assessment, Farsi District is in urgent need of winterization support. The community is trapped in a cycle of poverty and isolation, and without immediate assistance, the harsh winter will bring further suffering and loss. It is implored to consider providing the necessary resources to help these resilient families endure the winter and rebuild their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cordaid is set to deliver winterization assistance to 1030&#xa0;households (approximately 7210&#xa0;individuals). These beneficiaries represent the most vulnerable populations, including women, girls, children, those living with disabilities identified through assessment using the Washington Group set of questions, women-headed households, families with children under five years old, the elderly, and those suffering from chronic illnesses.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the survival and living standards of the most vulnerable families in the Farsi district of Herat Province by providing targeted winter assistance to uphold their dignity and well-being during the harsh winter months.</narrative>
  </description>
